  "id": "self-punishment",
  "term": "self-punishment",
  "definition": "Self-punishment is a function or purpose a behavior may serve for a person, especially in the context of self-harm or non-suicidal self-injury. It means the behavior is carried out as a way of punishing oneself rather than, for example, regulating emotion or communicating with others.",
